To avoid hallucinations, the model should only mention components that are explicitly present in the transcript, without inferring, completing, or inventing component names based on context or prior knowledge; additionally, a structural validation should verify that every mentioned_component literally exists in the transcript before generating the final result. In this case, fraud detection service should be removed, as it does not appear in the transcript.

Allowed statuses:

```text
new
modified
removed
unchanged
