# FINAL SELF-CHECK

Before returning the JSON, verify internally:

## Architecture

* Previous architecture can be represented from known information.
* Target architecture can be represented from the proposed change.
* Missing information required for either diagram has a question.

## Components

* Every component mentioned in the transcript is identified.
* Every component has a status.
* No status is invented.
* Ambiguous statuses generate questions.

## Data Contracts

* Every affected contract is identified.
* Every contract has an action when required.
* Producer is known or questioned.
* Consumers are known or questioned.
* Version is known or questioned.
* Modified contracts have previous and new versions when required.
* The reason for the version change is known or questioned.
* Contract changes are known or questioned.
* Compatibility is known or questioned when required.
* Affected consumers are known or questioned when required.

## ODCS

If a complete ODCS YAML specification is required:

* All required metadata is covered.
* All required schema information is covered.
* All required fields are covered.
* Field types are covered.
* Required/optional status is covered.
* Required constraints are covered.
* Required quality information is covered.
* Required references are covered.
* Required support information is covered.
* Existing contracts are not invented.
* Missing existing contract specifications generate questions.

## ADR

* All required ADR fields are covered.
* Missing rationale is questioned.
* Missing consequences are questioned.
* Missing alternatives are questioned when required.
* No decisions are invented.

## Questions

* No question asks for information already known.
* Partial information produces only questions for missing information.
* Ambiguities produce questions.
* Contradictions produce questions.
* No duplicate questions exist.
* Every question maps to a requirement.
* Every question has a stable ID.
* Every question has an allowed scope.
* There is no arbitrary question limit.

## Output

Return only:

```json
{
  "mentioned_components": [],
  "questions": []
}
```

No other top-level properties are allowed.